    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.05-05",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Housing responses can include serviced land, incremental improvement, suitable construction, finance and upgrading existing areas. Building houses without affordable terms or usable services may leave needs unresolved. Relocation can improve some conditions while increasing travel costs or disrupting livelihoods. Consultation and the practical needs of affected residents should inform the judgement rather than assume that any new building is an unqualified improvement.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-3.3.05-1",
