    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.05-08",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Windhoek provides a named upgrading case. City information describes a collaborative Informal Settlement Upgrading Project that supports affordable housing on serviced land, so that families can build on plots with water, sewerage and roads instead of in unplanned shacks. Upgrading of this kind keeps people near their jobs and neighbours, but plots, materials and loans must be affordable for the poorest households, and the city must keep pace with new arrivals.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-3.3.05-1",
        "CL-6137-3.3.05-2",
        "CL-6137-3.3.05-01-1",
        "CL-6137-3.3.05-01-2",
