      "repair_note": "Claude cross-review repairs: 6137-3.3-001, 6137-3.3-002, 6137-3.3-003, 6137-3.3-004, 6137-3.3-005, 6137-3.3-006, 6137-4.1-002, 6137-4.2-005"
