    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.05-12",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A supported solution states the problem, mechanism and criterion. A bus improvement can help access if it is reliable, safe, affordable and useful for relevant routes. Upgrading can help housing if services and terms fit residents' needs. Parking management can help a CBD if it addresses the observed conflict without simply displacing it. Monitoring should compare outcomes and affected groups over an appropriate period.",
      "claim_ids": [
