    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.05-15",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Affordability includes ongoing payments. A lower purchase price can help access, while loan repayment, transport and utility costs still affect a household's budget. A relocated home farther from work can increase journey costs even if its structure is better. A supported judgement compares the whole relevant arrangement under the supplied figures rather than treating any loan as an automatic improvement for every applicant.",
